      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسْرُوحٌ</span></b>  The <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَرَاب</span> [or <i>mirage</i>]: (K: [in some
copies of which, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الشَّرَابُ</span> is put in the place of
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السَّرَابُ</span>:]) mentioned on the authority of Th; but
he was not sure of its correctness: (TA:) a dial.
var. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَشْرُوحٌ</span> in this sense. (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شرح</span>.)

